{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/459486eb2f6c473346d281725318130a.avif?t=1774283254\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ashes &amp; Blood</strong> is an isometric, turn-based strategy RPG set in a dark medieval fantasy world. <br>Choose your faction, exploit the land, and bend the rules of war to your will. <br>Whether you're crushing enemies in tactical TRPG-style battles or expanding <br>your reach across a procedurally generated 4X world,<br> the power is yours\u2014and it's only growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game features two interconnected modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>World Mode</strong>, a dynamic 4X sandbox where you manage cities, <br>recruit armies, and try to conquer a procedurally generated map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Battle Mode</strong>, a rich tactical layer of grid-based combat with elevation,<br> status effects, and devastating profession-based combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/72078cd6dabd3b574e5b1c8854ac513e.poster.avif?t=1774283254\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/72078cd6dabd3b574e5b1c8854ac513e.webm?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/72078cd6dabd3b574e5b1c8854ac513e.mp4?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/86b7cbe816b6a374892047846fd7d51f.avif?t=1774283254\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But what truly sets <strong>Ashes &amp; Blood</strong> apart is its unapologetic embrace of <strong>player freedom </strong><br><br><br><br><strong>and broken builds</strong>. Want to exploit terrain generation to create a map tilted in your faction\u2019s<br> favor? Do it. Want to stack professions into a synergy so absurd it melts enemies <br>in one turn? That\u2019s the point. Each campaign you finish feeds into a <strong>meta-progression system</strong>, <br>unlocking even more powerful tools, traits, and map modifiers for future runs.<br> But don\u2019t feel to save, the combat is fast-paced, brutal and the AI <br>WILL give you a hard time, if you\u2019re not careful.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/bcd5f3f81d0258d89f1fed7b8a315964.poster.avif?t=1774283254\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/bcd5f3f81d0258d89f1fed7b8a315964.webm?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/bcd5f3f81d0258d89f1fed7b8a315964.mp4?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/6d654342895ca9b000eafa2d6b03c537.avif?t=1774283254\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dual Game Modes</strong>: Switch seamlessly between World Mode, a large-scale 4X<br> sandbox of exploration and conquest, and Battle Mode, a tactical TRPG-style<br> combat system with layered maps and precise unit control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Factions</strong>: Choose from <strong>humans, orcs</strong>, or <strong>velkyn</strong>, each with unique units, professions,<br> and tactical philosophies. Every faction plays differently\u2014and breaks differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Procedural Worldmap</strong>: Generate unique, strategic landscapes in a blink using<br> a custom algorithm that blends Voronoi diagrams, noise functions, and more.<br> Tweak parameters to tilt the world in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meta-Progression:</strong> Finish a campaign to unlock powerful perks<strong>, </strong>traits, or entirely<br> new professions for your faction in future runs. Your victories echo forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Profession System</strong>: Customize units using a primary + secondary profession system. <br>Stack ability synergies, build around specific strategies, or experiment with broken combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong>: Master elevation, flanking, terrain effects, and <br>status interactions in intense, turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/4b70265bc27cfcd3a95a57888a0a444b.poster.avif?t=1774283254\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/4b70265bc27cfcd3a95a57888a0a444b.webm?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/4b70265bc27cfcd3a95a57888a0a444b.mp4?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/fed53f47f50df4608ac10530fc361ebd.avif?t=1774283254\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Generate world maps <strong>biased toward your faction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stack buffs, debuffs, and status effects</strong> until the game engine trembles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign <strong>custom AI behaviors</strong> to individual units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Speed up time (to absurd amounts), automate armies, or micro<br> manage every aspect of the game - it is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ashes &amp; Blood</strong> <br>is a sandbox of strategy, designed to be broken by those clever enough to do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/ecebf0d0aa7c247437b37239bb539ea7.poster.avif?t=1774283254\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/ecebf0d0aa7c247437b37239bb539ea7.webm?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/ecebf0d0aa7c247437b37239bb539ea7.mp4?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac