s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong>: Master elevation, flanking, terrain effects, and <br>status interactions in intense, turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/4b70265bc27cfcd3a95a57888a0a444b.poster.avif?t=1774283254\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/4b70265bc27cfcd3a95a57888a0a444b.webm?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/4b70265bc27cfcd3a95a57888a0a444b.mp4?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/fed53f47f50df4608ac10530fc361ebd.avif?t=1774283254\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Generate world maps <strong>biased toward your faction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stack buffs, debuffs, and status effects</strong> until the game engine trembles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign <strong>custom AI behaviors</strong> to individual units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Speed up time (to absurd amounts), automate armies, or micro<br> manage every aspect of the game - it is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ashes &amp; Blood</strong> <br>is a sandbox of strategy, designed to be broken by those clever enough to do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/ecebf0d0aa7c247437b37239bb539ea7.poster.avif?t=1774283254\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/ecebf0d0aa7c247437b37239bb539ea7.webm?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/extras/ecebf0d0aa7c247437b37239bb539ea7.mp4?t=1774283254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Small Strategy"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3671750/1bd81a0f6092e3d0680198b8fc07d392c0bece86/header.jpg?t=1774283254","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3671750/1330796109/2afefc7d2077cf503d899aaa4ae713ef814a67ca/1774282608/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774283253","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3671750/1330796109/2afefc7d2077cf503d899aaa4ae713ef814a67ca/1774282608/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774283253","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3671750/1330796109/2afefc7d2077cf503d899aaa4ae713ef814a67ca/1774282608/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774283253","id":257307861,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257307861/859bbe068fdfe137568e0fa7f17f9c325cea464e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1774283253"}],"name":"Ashes & Blood","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2500 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVID